    (2017, N'Physics', N'Electricity and Magnetism', N'Current Electricity', 137, N'A copper wire resistance element has a baseline rating of R. If this wire element is drawn out through a drawing die to stretch its length to three times its initial specification uniformly, what is its updated resistance?', N'9R', N'3R', N'R / 3', N'R / 9', 'C', N'Stretching operations maintain total volume. Tripling length forces the cross-sectional boundary down to A/3. Given R = rho * L / A, the updated parameters shift resistance to R'' = rho * (3L) / (A/3) = 9R.'),
    (2017, N'Physics', N'Modern Physics', N'Dual Nature of Radiation and Matter', 138, N'If the linear momentum of a free moving particle is decreased by exactly half, how does its de Broglie wavelength parameter respond?', N'It increases by a factor of two', N'It drops by exactly half', N'It increases fourfold', N'It remains completely unchanged', 'A', N'The de Broglie relation is lambda = h / p. Because wavelength is inversely proportional to momentum, changing the momentum value to p/2 causes the tracking wavelength to scale up to 2 * lambda.'),
    (2017, N'Physics', N'Mechanics', N'Gravitation', 139, N'The orbital velocity (v_o) of an artificial satellite orbiting immediately adjacent to the surface of a spherical planet relates to its escape velocity (v_e) from that same surface via which factor?', N'v_e = sqrt(2) * v_o', N'v_e = 2 * v_o', N'v_o = sqrt(2) * v_e', N'v_e = v_o / sqrt(2)', 'C', N'Escape velocity profiles expand to v_e = sqrt(2GM/R) while grazing stable circular orbit speeds require v_o = sqrt(GM/R). Evaluating the two speeds verifies that v_e matches sqrt(2) * v_o.'),
    (2017, N'Physics', N'Optics', N'Wave Optics', 140, N'In a Young''s double-slit experiment assembly, if the structural separation distance between the two slits is doubled while keeping other components fixed, the resulting fringe width changes by what factor?', N'0.5', N'2', N'4', N'0.25', 'D', N'Fringe spacing parameters are calculated from the relation beta = lambda * D / d. Since fringe width beta holds an inverse relationship with slit separation d, doubling d cuts the fringe width to exactly half its initial size.'),
    (2017, N'Physics', N'Electricity and Magnetism', N'Semiconductor Electronics', 141, N'The dynamic processing component that functions as an absolute electronic valve, allowing current passage exclusively in a single direction while blocking reverse currents, is a/an:', N'p-n junction diode', N'Bipolar junction transistor', N'Carbon composition resistor', N'Air-gap capacitor', 'A', N'A p-n junction diode displays strongly asymmetric electrical conductivity, conducting current easily under forward bias conditions while exhibiting near-infinite resistance under reverse bias.'),
